# Workstation Homebrew inventory.
# Restore with: brew bundle --file=~/.config/workstation/Brewfile
#
# Notes:
# - The OpenCode CLI is installed by its own installer into ~/.opencode/bin,
#   not by Homebrew. The desktop client is the `opencode-desktop` cask below.
# - Node is managed by fnm, so Homebrew `node` is not pinned here; it is pulled
#   in as a dependency where needed.

